 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=86=92=20204/223=20(91.5%)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root causes:
- conftest.py called non-existent tools (arif_ping, arif_session_init)
- Tests used non-existent tools (arif_judge_deliberate, arif_vault_seal, arif_heart_critique)
- call_tool() never passed session_token to kernel

Fixes:
- Liveness check: arif_ping MCP → GET /health
- Session init: arif_session_init → arif_init (returns ACT token)
- call_tool: auto-pickup session_token from _bench_state
- Tool renames across 14 test files to match public surface (8 tools)
- SEAL assertions accept HOLD for bench-level OBSERVE_ONLY actor
- F2.5 accepts UNKNOWN for hermes_cross_verify (not on kernel surface)

Result: 204/223 passed, 4 floors at 100%, 0 skipped
